# === 4ndr0666 === #
# Monitor Profiles Directory

# Create a Monitor profile you want to use in this directory.
# Create a unique file name ending in .lua (e.g. Mirror.lua, Office.lua, Scale.lua).

# Tip: You can easily create a layout profile using nwg-displays.
# After creating a profile using nwg-displays, adapt the translated lines from 
# ~/.config/hypr/monitors.lua into a new file in this directory.
# It is highly suggested not to call it "default.lua".

# Note: After selecting your desired profile via Rofi (SUPER SHIFT E), the active 
# configuration will be swapped out. Previous profiles will be backed up 
# automatically as Previous_Profile.lua.

# Profiles load automatically once chosen from the menu unless auto-reload is disabled[cite: 73, 74].
# If changes do not reflect instantly, log out and log back in (especially in VMs)[cite: 74, 75].